<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Text and voice send the same session id, so one AgentCore Memory thread spans both.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; The runtime resource policy denies every caller except the front door role, so WAF and the rate limit cannot be bypassed.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; The tools gateway validates the user JWT again; Lambda targets apply Aurora RLS per tenant.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Charts: the agent emits &amp;lt;chart s3key&amp;gt;; the runtime presigns it before the reply leaves." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;absoluteArcSize=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Amazon Ember;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8FA3B8;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="95" y="690" width="875" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
